# A reference-to-pointer cast, which Verus cannot state: the pointer names
# the atomic it was made from while that atomic stays in place.
usize_ptr	raw pointer (internal)	Kani	trusted (partly checked, Kani: vspec::atom::kani_atom::usize_ptr_names_its_atomic; not checked: that `r` carries `a`'s provenance, so loads and stores through it reach `a` (the harness compares addresses))	contract 1082442458, body 2711750530
# Kani runs each wrapper on a real atomic, one thread (src/kani/atomic.rs).
# loom and C11 (verus/WEAKMEM.md): the class table's watermark
# (`committed_slabs`) is written only by `store_usize` and its class-line
# copy (`ClassLine::committed`) only by `store_usize_at`; only
# class/table.rs calls these wrappers and only heap/shared.rs makes a
# copy's pointer (`usize_ptr`); this file mints one UsizePerm per atomic,
# in `new_usize` (tests/loom/tests/access.rs). C++20's coherence rules
# ([intro.races]) give a load a write no older than the last one that
# happens before it, so the permission's value at its place in the
# atomic's modification order; the stores are made under the commit lock,
# which orders them, and `WatermarkPred` bounds one atomic by constants,
# so any ordering keeps it. `load_usize_seen`'s witness, the owner words
# of every group below the value read, needs the `Release` store and its
# `Acquire` load (a release/acquire pair, [atomics.order] p2), which the
# watermark and free models check; `load_u16_at` reads an owner word whose
# only write is `table::store_owner`'s, so a load ordered after it reads
# its value (a free not ordered after its allocation can read 0, the free
# models' documented fast-path miss). The models run copies of the
# `SlabTable` steps (tests/loom/tests/pins.rs).
store_usize	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::atom_store_usize, and loom: watermark::loom_watermark_take_group_publishes, free::loom_free_after_synchronised_handoff and bitmap::loom_bitmap_init_is_published; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the models replace with loom's `store` inside copies of the table steps, in the configurations their files state; the C11 argument above that the permission's value is the watermark's last write, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)	contract 3684131722, body 3052065581
load_usize	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::atom_load_usize, and loom: watermark::loom_watermark_take_group_publishes, free::loom_free_after_synchronised_handoff and free::loom_free_after_relaxed_handoff; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the models replace with loom's `load` inside copies of the table steps, in the configurations their files state; the C11 argument above, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)	contract 1353355935, body 3163496896
store_usize_at	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::atom_store_usize_at, and loom: watermark::loom_watermark_mirror_follows, watermark::loom_watermark_mirror_installed_concurrently and free::loom_free_after_synchronised_handoff; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the models replace with loom's `store` inside copies of the table steps, in the configurations their files state; that `p` reaches the copy `usize_ptr` made it from (`usize_ptr`'s provenance, itself trusted); the C11 argument above, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)	contract 3281897512, body 2105851067
load_usize_seen	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, loom: watermark::loom_watermark_take_group_publishes, free::loom_free_after_synchronised_handoff, free::loom_free_after_relaxed_handoff and bitmap::loom_bitmap_init_is_published; not checked: this body, which the models replace with loom's `Acquire` load inside copies of the table steps, in the configurations their files state; the ghost half (the invariant opened around the load, the persistent set duplicated and frozen), an argument about vstd's resource algebra that no tool checks; the C11 argument above that the permission's value is the watermark's last write, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)	contract 3762602297, body 696989655
load_u16_at	atomics primitive	loom/GenMC	trusted (partly checked, Kani: kani_proofs::atomic::atom_load_u16_at, and loom: watermark::loom_watermark_take_group_publishes, free::loom_free_after_synchronised_handoff and free::loom_free_after_relaxed_handoff; not checked: this body under concurrency, which the models replace with loom's `load` inside copies of the table steps, in the configurations their files state; that every write to the owner word is `class::table::store_owner`'s (itself trusted) or vstd's `AtomicU16::store` spec, apart from the test helper `SlabTable::corrupt_owner_word`, which tests/loom/tests/access.rs backs by matching source text only)	contract 741036831, body 1754619584
